1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,100
A whole village, built in the shape of an ox.
整座村子·照牛的样子造

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,600
Not by accident — planned that way 900 years ago.
不是巧合·900年前就规划好

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,000
A hill is the head, two old trees the horns.
山是牛头·两棵老树是牛角

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,400
Canals wind through as the "intestines."
水渠蜿蜒·就是牛肠

6
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,800
They carry fresh water to every doorstep.
活水·引到每家门口

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,200
A crescent pond at the center — the "stomach."
月沼在中心·是牛胃

8
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,600
138 Ming and Qing houses still stand.
138座明清古宅·至今犹在

9
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:21,000
A living village that flows like a painting.
活着的村子·美成一幅画

10
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,800
★ Expert Tip: Come at dawn — the pond mirrors the whole village, no crowds.
★清晨来·月沼倒影最静

11
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,400
An ox-shaped village, alive 900 years. Dawn or dusk — when would you go?
牛形古村·活了900年·清晨还是黄昏来？
